WHO OWNS WHAT IN HERE

The licence above covers this repository's own work — `checks/`, `.github/`, and
the documentation — and it covers the tools under `tools/`.

It covers the tools because mimawsi.com asks for that when a tool is submitted.
A maker confirms the file is theirs to give and agrees it is published under the
MIT licence above. They keep the copyright in their own work; what they grant is
the permission this licence describes, to anyone.

That is deliberate. The point of publishing a tool here is that somebody can read
it, check it, and take it away and use it. A repository of files nobody may reuse
would satisfy the letter of "verifiable" and none of the reason for it.

**Every tool in here as of 2026-09-06 was submitted by the operator**, so nothing
currently in `tools/` belongs to a third party. The terms above exist so that is
still true in spirit when it stops being true in fact.

If you are the author of a tool in here and something about this is wrong, say
so and it will be removed. That is a promise this project would rather keep than
argue about.
